  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multimodal models with multiprofile, transformer aggregation, and weighted fusion (e.g., config_039) achieve the highest accuracy (0.724989). This experiment tests whether replacing the RNA encoder from scvi_n200 (used in config_039) with scgpt (a more complex encoder) improves performance further. It isolates the effect of RNA encoder choice while keeping other critical components (image encoder, aggregation, fusion) consistent, addressing uncertainty about whether more complex RNA representations benefit this setup."
